      "text": "Home\n\nTrading rules\n\nEvaluation rules\n\nFAQ\n\nLog in\n\nBlog\n\nEvaluation rules\n\nThe evaluation has one phase. Traders must trade a minimum of five days and meet the profit target.\n\nConsistency\n\nNo single trading day may account for more than 40% of total profit during the evaluation.\n\nWeekend holding\n\nPositions must be closed before the Friday session ends.\n\nTerms of use",
